        "description": "Detection of colchicine in blood or urine by toxicological analysis",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "History of colchicine ingestion plus presence of severe gastrointestinal symptoms; supportive laboratory or toxicology findings strengthen diagnosis",
